# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum business skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Realiza un examen de 20 preguntas en el sitio web de IBM Training para evaluar tus conocimientos sobre negocios cuánticos y obtener una insignia a través de Credly."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam | Quantum business foundations"
msgstr "Examen | Quantum Business Foundations"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "Examen e insignia {#exam-and-badge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum.](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Una insignia cuadrada con el nombre de este curso, el nivel básico y el emisor IBM Quantum.](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam/badge.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Encuesta posterior al curso {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing this course! Please take a moment to help us improve our course by filling out the following [quick survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_9EoiWO5bbHxqUPc). Your feedback will be used to enhance our content offering and user experience. Thank you!\n"
msgstr "¡Felicidades por completar este curso! Tómate un momento para ayudarnos a mejorar nuestro curso completando la siguiente [encuesta rápida](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_9EoiWO5bbHxqUPc). Tus comentarios se utilizarán para mejorar nuestra oferta de contenido y la experiencia del usuario. ¡Gracias!\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Pon a prueba tus conocimientos {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM&reg; Training, where you can take the badging exam for Quantum business foundations.\n"
msgstr "Después de haber completado las lecturas y actividades de este curso, haz clic en el botón de abajo para ir a IBM&reg; Training, donde podrás realizar el examen de certificación de Quantum Business Foundations.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you use to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr "El examen consta de 20 preguntas, de las cuales debes responder correctamente al menos 16 para aprobar. Después de aprobar, tu insignia se enviará automáticamente a la dirección de correo electrónico con la que te registraste en IBM Training.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Asegúrate de estar preparado para realizar el examen. Si no obtienes una puntuación suficiente en dos intentos, el examen se bloqueará temporalmente.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr "Nota: Estos exámenes en el sitio web de IBM Training pueden no estar disponibles temporalmente en los próximos días debido a trabajos de mantenimiento.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/quantum-business-foundations-badge-quiz-DL46104G\" />\n"
msgstr "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/quantum-business-foundations-badge-quiz-DL46104G\" />\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
msgstr "NOTA: IBM utiliza los servicios de Credly, un proveedor externo de procesamiento de datos autorizado por IBM con sede en los Estados Unidos, para apoyar la administración del programa IBM Digital Badge. Para poder emitirte un IBM Digital Badge, tus datos personales (nombre, dirección de correo electrónico e insignia obtenida) se compartirán con Credly. Recibirás una notificación por correo electrónico de Credly con instrucciones para canjear la insignia. Tus datos personales se utilizarán para la emisión de tu insignia, así como para informes del programa y fines operativos. IBM puede compartir los datos personales recopilados con subsidiarias de IBM y terceros en todo el mundo. Se tratarán de manera consistente con las prácticas de privacidad de IBM. La declaración de privacidad de IBM puede consultarse [aquí](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
